    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28582" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῠνάστ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lord, master, ruler</i>, of Zeus, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				608
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνδρες δ.</span>
			<i>the chief men</i> in a state, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.32
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				473d
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>petty chief, princelet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.33
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡγεμόσι καὶ δ. καὶ βασιλεῦσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					9.23.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				10.34.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Posidon.
				50
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.3.25
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπροὶ δυνάσται</span>, of the
			stars, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				6
			</span></i>.</div>
